ADJUST copy_id
REPLY QR RD RA SERVFAIL
SECTION QUESTION
q1.example.com. IN A
SECTION ADDITIONAL
	HEX_EDNSDATA_BEGIN
		ff c8
		00 0a
		01 05
		00 00 00 00 00 00 00 03
	HEX_EDNSDATA_END
ENTRY_END

STEP 60 CHECK_ANSWER
ENTRY_BEGIN
